				\begin{document}$$Chlorophyll\,a\,\left( {\mu g/mg} \right) \, = \, \left( { - 8.096A_{652} + \, 16.517A_{665} } \right)/sample\,dry\,weight$$\end{document}Chlorophyllaμg/mg=-8.096A652+16.517A665/sampledryweight2\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
